{{/* An inline citation: every [[ID]] and [[ID|label]] in Markdown on a page
     (provenance-ddf DES-0046). Receives the cited entity, as in
     Document.tmpl's .Citations, with .CitationIndex, .TypeCitationIndex and
     .CitationLabel (the label, or empty). [[ID#field]] and [[#caption]]
     don't come here.

     - A Reference shows as its number in a Document's External list, [1],
       linked to its own page (a page without the list still has that). A
       label is a locator within it: [[REF-0001|clause 7]] shows
       [3, clause 7].
     - Anything else shows as without this template: its ID, or its label,
       linked. */}}
{{- if eq .Type "Reference" -}}
[{{link . .TypeCitationIndex}}{{with .CitationLabel}}, {{.}}{{end}}]
{{- else if .CitationLabel -}}
{{link . .CitationLabel}}
{{- else -}}
{{link .}}
{{- end}}
